  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "# Issue:\nWhen clicking on input fields (e.g. a Video Player) your Keyboard will open up. It will also open an invisible Menu behind it though. You can see the Tooltips and interact with it, though I don't think anything happens when clicking on buttons (other than the interaction sound playing)\n**Steps to reproduce:**\n1. Go into a World with a Video Player\n2. Click on the URL Input Field of the Video Player\nIf you then move you cursor below or next to the Keyboard you will notice the Menu Tooltips.\n# Attachments:\nHere is a video showcasing the issue: https://streamable.com/y6ezi6",
